('38765', '_transient_novamira_update_info', 'a:13:{s:4:\"name\";s:8:\"Novamira\";s:7:\"version\";s:6:\"1.11.6\";s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Dynamic.ooo\";s:15:\"author_homepage\";s:24:\"https://www.dynamic.ooo/\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:19:\"https://novamira.ai\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.9\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"8.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:3:\"7.1\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2026-08-26 18:14:27\";s:8:\"sections\";a:2:{s:9:\"changelog\";s:379:\"v1.11.6 - 2026/08/26<br />* Fix: Novamira no longer announces classes of its bundled MCP Adapter at a location the plugin does not ship. On a site where another plugin checks whether those classes exist, that check ended in a critical error on every page after updating to 1.11.5.<br /><br /><br />For full list of changelog <a href=\"https://novamira.ai/changelog\">click here</a>\";s:11:\"description\";s:470:\"Novamira turns your WordPress site into a programmable environment for AI. Your AI client connects to your site directly over the Model Context Protocol and works with real PHP, the database, files, themes, and plugins, the same building blocks you would use yourself. The plugin runs on your own server, so the connection is direct: no proxy, and no data passing through our servers. Your AI, your WordPress. Nothing in between. Built for development and staging sites.\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:2:{s:2:\"1x\";s:60:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/icon-128x128.png\";s:2:\"2x\";s:60:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/icon-256x256.png\";}s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:4:\"high\";s:63:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/banner-1544x500.png\";s:3:\"low\";s:62:\"https://license.dynamic.ooo/assets/novamira/banner-772x250.png\";}s:12:\"download_url\";s:87:\"https://nbg1.your-objectstorage.com/ooo-zips-free/novamira/versions/novamira-1.11.6.zip\";}', 'off'),
